#Протокол_Graph_Canvas_Lit_Flow_V1<[
Базис:
  AN-4 (analytics:graph-visualization-engine): product canvas = lit-flow (@xyflow/system + Lit Web Components), референс UX — n8n на Vue Flow.
  Mermaid только docs/export; runtime UI — GraphCanvasLitFlowProjection → client island.
Вектор:
  Server: architecture / schematic / intent projection → workgraph.graph-canvas-lit-flow-projection.v1 JSON.
  Client: mount flow-canvas + custom graph-card-node; graph-node-click → drawer bridge в backlog UI.
  Pan/zoom, fitView, minimap, keyboard lineage traversal — в client bundle, не inline SVG.
Цель:
  Один graph canvas runtime на все graph views; кликабельные HTML-карточки; без legacy static HTML+SVG render path.

Проверки:
  schema graph-canvas-lit-flow-projection.v1.json согласован с mount contract
  event graph-node-click документирован (detail: taskId | intentNodeId | blockId | schematicId)
  nodesDraggable=false, nodesConnectable=false (read-only lineage viewer)

Метки:
